because there's inevitably going to be some changes that need to be made. When I was working on the Granbury Pesto Hotel, I had to make a little notebook for Ray Finds' character, Gustav. Gustav is a very precise character. When Ray Finds came in for his costume fitting, he had his notebook and all the other props that he needed for his character. He just noticed that there were no lines in the notebook, given that he made him a notebook with blank pages.
