So that's a huge set for the graphics department. There are lots of scenes that have a very low volume of graphics naturally. Like, you can kind of skim read a sex scene really. Nobody ever pulls out a newspaper or starts looking in a map. So funny. Let's talk a little bit about, so once you get the list of things that you have to work on, you begin to research what those things are, what they're like for this film. And could you describe what the research is like? So I start my research, I do a little bit of research online, but I find
